					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						722640212
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 722640212,
					"content": "不過，吉法師竟然知道櫻吹雪這樣的詞，應該說不愧是稻妻的妖狸嗎…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						722640213
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 722640213,
					"content": "呶！是雪！好冷好冷！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						722640214
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「吉法師」"
				},
				{
					"id": 722640214,
					"content": "吉法師看起來好高興。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						722640215
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 722640215,
					"content": "山有雪所以冷，還是山很冷所以雪？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						722640216
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「吉法師」"
				},
				{
					"id": 722640216,
					"content": "……",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						722640217
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 722640217,
					"content": "#欸，這個問題問得好。{NICKNAME}，{F#妳}{M#你}覺得雪是什麼？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						722640218,
						722640221,
						722640224
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 722640218,
					"content": "是水元素吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						722640219
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 722640219,
					"content": "唔…如果是這樣的話，那就是因為這裡很冷，所以水元素結冰了，變成了雪…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						722640220
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 722640220,
					"content": "好冷好冷。好多雪。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						722640228
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「吉法師」"
				},
				{
					"id": 722640228,
					"content": "不管怎麼說，這種事情，以後有機會問問麗莎這樣知識淵博的人吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						722640229
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 722640229,
					"content": "龍脊雪山雖然很冷，但和蒙德別的地方不一樣，空氣也很清新，讓人頭腦清醒呢。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						722640230
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 722640230,
					"content": "而且，有好多地方我們也沒有探索過。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						722640231
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 722640231,
					"content": "#{NICKNAME}，以後有機會的話，我們深入雪山看看吧！說不定有被冰封的寶藏呢！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						722640232
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 722640232,
					"content": "寶藏！寶藏好東西。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						722640233
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「吉法師」"
				},
				{
					"id": 722640233,
					"content": "吉法師和派蒙說不定很合得來。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						722640234
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 722640234,
					"content": "哼哼，沒有寶藏，怎麼過好日子、吃好東西。吉法師挺懂的嘛。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						722640235
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 722640235,
					"content": "吉法師想在雪裡玩。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						722640236
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「吉法師」"
				},
				{
					"id": 722640236,
					"content": "嗯，別著涼哦！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						722640237
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 722640237,
					"content": "如果遇到危險的話…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						722640238
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 722640238,
					"content": "大喊「有寶藏」就好。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						722640239
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 722640239,
					"content": "喂！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 722640221,
					"content": "是冰元素吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						722640222
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 722640222,
					"content": "欸？是這樣嗎？這樣的話，就是因為雪是冰元素，所以讓這裡變得很冷…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						722640223
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 722640223,
					"content": "好冷好冷。好多雪。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						722640228
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「吉法師」"
				},
				{
					"id": 722640224,
					"content": "是凱亞幹的吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						722640225
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 722640225,
					"content": "「小心著涼！」",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						722640226
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 722640226,
					"content": "不對！再怎麼說，凱亞也沒這麼厲害吧！",
