				{
					"id": 722640514,
					"content": "？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						722640515
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 722640515,
					"content": "（向吉法師解釋相片的事情…）",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						722640516
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 722640516,
					"content": "原來是畫。白毛真笨。呶哈哈。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						722640517
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「吉法師」"
				},
				{
					"id": 722640517,
					"content": "嗚嗚，雖然好生氣，但不知道怎麼反駁…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						722640518
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 722640518,
					"content": "不笑了。一起笑才是好的。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						722640519
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「吉法師」"
				},
				{
					"id": 722640519,
					"content": "可惡…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						722640520
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 722640520,
					"content": "吉法師真乖，表揚。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						722640521
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 722640521,
					"content": "表揚！耶！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						722640522
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「吉法師」"
				},
				{
					"id": 722640522,
					"content": "嗯…那今天就到這裡吧。吉法師也累了吧？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						722640523
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 722640523,
					"content": "嗯。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						722640524
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「吉法師」"
				},
				{
					"id": 722640524,
					"content": "那我們回去向五百藏報告吧。畢竟，五百藏感覺還挺擔心的。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 722640503,
					"content": "為了養活派蒙，鍛鍊出的本領。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						722640504
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 722640504,
					"content": "喂！真沒禮貌。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						722640505
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				}
			]
		},
		{
